			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・ヒント2-0</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-01T10:02:24" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWPLAZMAM
プラズマ団♂・したっぱ２</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-01T10:02:14" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_hide_ship_hint2_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>たしか　ほのおタイプの　ポケモンだ！▼
おまえが　どこまで　やれるか
たのしませて　もらうと　するか</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-20T12:21:26" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-25T10:47:53" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>たしか　ほのおタイプの　ポケモンだ！▼
おまえが　どこまで　やれるか
楽しませて　もらうと　するか</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-20T12:20:49" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-25T10:47:53" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・ヒント2-1
・レシラムのヒント</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-10T08:20:36" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWPLAZMAM
プラズマ団♂・したっぱ２</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-25T12:28:18" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
